### ⚠️ Critical Notes & Caveats

1.  **Greedy Purity Warning (Block 10 & 13):**
    *  1.45.968.194 I slot print_timing: id  0 | task 0 | n_gen =   1465, tg =  24.25 t/s, tg_3s =  28.66 t/s
